

1. Objectives of Music Playlist Manager
1. To develop a music playlist management system using C programming.
2. To use a Doubly Linked List to add, display, and delete songs.
3. To use a Circular Linked List to play songs continuously.
4. To use a Stack to store recently played songs.
5. To use a Queue to manage songs waiting to be played.
6. To understand the practical applications of data structures.
